  "2026-08-31T22:36:29.834Z","harness:codex","Review round 7 recurrence: CodeRabbit comment 3899001129 is valid. The item comments and terminal fields record context --for orient as the measured winner, but the persistent body still calls contracts --summary plus next canonical. Update the body through pm so historical events remain immutable while current metadata becomes unambiguous."
