  "2026-09-01T01:16:35.046Z","harness:codex","Hosted coverage negative control at exact head 7924622a6: all 8,215 tests passed, but the mandatory gate correctly failed at 45,789/45,790 branches. The uncovered branch is the malformed orientation protocols container fallback at agent-task-token-gate.mjs:373; add a valid-required-capabilities plus undefined-protocols rejection case without exclusions."
